  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector study solar renewable energy, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aimed market study will map the solar renewable energy sector &#x2013; with a focus on activity clusters of the Netherlands (NL) &#x2013; in Bangladesh (BD), its key public-private actors and linkages, trends, issues, challenges and (business) opportunities. The outcome will:i.	Provide to-the-point details for Dutch companies and institutes active in the solar market value chain to elevate the solar energy sector of Bangladesh through investments, knowledge and technology; ii.	Provide further insight and pave ways for interventions to support relevant supervisory, facilitating and regulatory bodies and key chain actors and businesses in Bangladesh;iii.	Incentives and opportunities available to attract foreign (Dutch) investment in Bangladesh;iv.	List of laws, regulations and policies that are important to know for foreign investors;v.	Provide further insight on how the development of the solar energy sector in Bangladesh can contribute to socio-economic development.The overall purpose is to realise the growth and development of the Bangladesh solar energy sector to support its green transition and private sector development and increase NL-BD trade and investment sustainably and responsibly.</narrative>
  </description>
